# Campus fee receiving (implementation)

**Start with `campus-fee-domain.mdc`** for contracts. Open this file only when editing receive/receipt/history code.

## Implementation anchors

- Balance: `GetFeeBalanceAsync` — family by `Family_Code` unless `singleStudent`.
- Receive: `ReceiveFeeAsync` — serializable txn; `AllocateReceiptIdsAsync` / `tblFeeReceiptSequence`.
- Void/edit: `FeeReceiptHistoryService` — affects regenerate (tuition charge floor).
